#
# Clean conformance fixture for math:ProbabilityEventOccurrentDisjointShape (Rule P11): a
# math:ProbabilityEvent — a measurable set of outcomes (the rain-event SET in a forecast
# space) — that is NOT typed logic:Event, so the sh:not [ sh:class logic:Event ] stays
# satisfied. It carries neither math:hasElement nor math:memberCondition, so the inherited
# math:Set extent SPARQL gate stays silent. It MUST raise NO probability failure class.
# Positive counterpart of counter-examples/probability-event-occurrent-conflation.ttl.
# Bound by tests/example-conformance.ttl (ex:ecProbabilityEventDistinct).
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:rainEventSet a math:ProbabilityEvent .
